228	|---|---|---|
229	| 1 | `createSession` with title "Como lidar com ansiedade antes de apresentações" | `chat-sessions-create` called with `{"title": "..."}` verbatim; parsed `ChatSession` upserted into `cachedSessions` |
230	| 2 | `listSessions()` → `AuthExpiredFailure` on first call, success on the retry | exactly one `SessionRepository.refresh()` call, then one more `listSessions` call; final result is `Right` |
231	| 3 | `listMessages('s1')` succeeds | `cachedMessages('s1')` returns that exact list afterward; `ChatLocalCache.writeMessagesForSession('s1', ...)` called once |
232	| 4 | `cachedMessages('never-opened')` | returns `null` (Clarification 3's "nothing cached for it") |
233	| 5 | `sendMessage(...)` stream: first item is `Left(AuthExpiredFailure)`, refresh succeeds, re-called stream then succeeds normally | exactly one refresh call; the caller sees only the second call's items (the first `AuthExpiredFailure` is swallowed, not yielded) |
